  ],
  "text": "`BaseModel.dict()` is deprecated in Pydantic V2 and renamed to `model_dump()`.",
  "fix": "Replace `.dict(...)` with `.model_dump(...)`; the keyword arguments (`include`, `exclude`, `exclude_none`, `by_alias`, ...) are the same."
