  "text": "`@validator` is deprecated in Pydantic V2 in favor of `@field_validator`.",
  "fix": "Use `@field_validator(\"field\")` stacked on `@classmethod`. `pre=True` becomes `mode=\"before\"`, `each_item=True` has no direct equivalent (validate the item type instead), and `always=True` becomes `Field(validate_default=True)`."
